 "Parenting Teens: Guiding with Patience, Respect, and Support"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog/post/~board/jis-blog/post/parenting-teens-guiding-with-patience-respect-and-support", "Read More about Parenting Teens: Guiding with Patience, Respect, and Support"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog/post/~board/jis-blog/post/future-ready-with-international-baccalaureate-why-jis-invests-in-global-holistic-education", ""], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog/post/~board/jis-blog/post/future-ready-with-international-baccalaureate-why-jis-invests-in-global-holistic-education", "Future-Ready with International Baccalaureate: Why JIS Invests in Global, Holist"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog/post/~board/jis-blog/post/future-ready-with-international-baccalaureate-why-jis-invests-in-global-holistic-education", "Read More about Future-Ready with International Baccalaureate: Why JIS Invests i"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog/post/~board/jis-blog/post/asclepius", ""]], "skipped": [["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @div.fsElementContent#", 5434], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @article.fsStyleAutoclear fsBoard-105 slick-slide#", 5106], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @article.fsStyleAutoclear fsBoard-105 fsCategory-#", 2282], ["nav @nav.#", 1465], ["[class*=\"mega-menu\" i] @div.mega-menu#", 1097], ["script @script.#", 921], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @article.fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTy#", 631], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @div.fsElementFooterContent#", 618]], "sample": "", "role": "home"}, {"url": "https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "title": "Mission and Vision - Jakarta Intercultural School", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[18, "a", -54, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [17, "h2", 179, 1, 1, "About"], [48, "h1", 363, 1, 0, "Mission and Vision"], [26, "span", 531, 1, 0, "Our Mission and Vision guide everything that we do from how we learn to the dispositions that JIS students gain while at our school."], [18, "li", 675, 1, 0, "We are passionate, inquisitive and creative – learning in Indonesia to be best for the world."], [18, "li", 733, 1, 0, "We value perseverance, integrity, responsibility, respect, compassion, balance and fun."], [18, "li", 791, 1, 0, "We will inspire joyful, rigorous learning and foster wellness as a pioneering, inclusive, and collaborative community."], [18, "li", 849, 1, 0, "We learn by reflecting and relating, by being resourceful and resilient."], [30, "h2", 1056, 0, 1, "How do we define learning?"], [18, "p", 1112, 0, 1, "Learning is a lifelong process that transforms us through rigorous engagement in meaningful experiences. At JIS, quality learning happens when students are resourceful, resilient, relating, and reflective. We call these the 4 Rs."], [18, "a", 1190, 0, 0, "Resourceful"], [18, "a", 1190, 0, 0, "Resilient"], [18, "a", 1190, 0, 0, "Relating"], [18, "a", 1190, 0, 0, "Reflective"], [18, "p", 1264, 0, 0, "Resourceful learning is happening when learners:"], [18, "li", 1313, 0, 0, "identify, access, and utilize various resources including community members (peers, teachers, coaches) and the environment to support and enhance their learning/passions"], [18, "p", 1400, 0, 0, "integrate concepts and apply learning to relevant problems flexibly (personally, locally, and globally)"], [18, "p", 1458, 0, 0, "actively explore, experiment, and engage in guided inquiry"], [18, "p", 1487, 0, 0, "apply creative solutions to achieve learning outcomes"], [18, "p", 1516, 0, 0, "verify and evaluate the credibility and quality of information and seek alternative sources when needed"], [30, "h2", 1614, 0, 1, "Shared Learning and Pedagogical Approaches"], [18, "p", 1706, 0, 1, "At JIS we strive to:"], [18, "li", 1755, 0, 0, "cultivate a safe, inclusive, and empowering learning environment that supports all learners’ emotional, social and cognitive development"], [18, "p", 1842, 0, 0, "use the backward-by-design planning model"], [18, "p", 1871, 0, 0, "design materials and assessments that are situated in meaningful contexts"], [18, "p", 1929, 0, 0, "explore a variety of resources to foster and enhance learning"], [18, "p", 1958, 0, 0, "expose students to varied learning experiences to build resilience"], [18, "p", 1987, 0, 0, "make lesson goals clear"], [18, "p", 2016, 0, 0, "regularly assess students to determine their current level of understanding/performance in order to prepare next steps"], [18, "p", 2074, 0, 0, "accommodate student needs by differentiating instruction and offering multiple modes of assessment"], [18, "p", 2132, 0, 0, "give feedback that is aligned with learning goals"], [18, "p", 1755, 0, 0, "ask questions and provide meaningful experiences that allow students to apply their learning"], [18, "p", 1813, 0, 0, "challenge students’ misconceptions"], [18, "p", 1842, 0, 0, "promote associations between learning and the transfer of learning"], [18, "p", 1900, 0, 0, "model, provide exemplars, and scaffold learning to give students enough information to help them acquire concepts"], [18, "p", 1958, 0, 0, "provide students with methods and approaches to consider how they learn and to choose relevant strategies for effective learning"], [18, "p", 2016, 0, 0, "provide opportunities for each student to personalize their learning and explore their passions"], [18, "p", 2074, 0, 0, "ensure students are working to expand their comfort zone and support cognitive struggle by differentiating learning experiences"]], "links": [["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "About"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Mission and Vision"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/school-leadership", "School Leadership"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/work-at-jis", "Work at JIS"], ["https://www.