ision", "Mission and Vision"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/school-leadership", "School Leadership"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/work-at-jis", "Work at JIS"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/child-safeguarding", "Child Safeguarding"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/belonging", "Belonging"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media", "News & Media"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/75-birthday", "75 Birthday"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "About"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Resourceful"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Resilient"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Relating"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Reflective"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Resourceful"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Resilient"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Relating"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Reflective"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", ""], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", ""]], "skipped": [["nav @nav.#", 1565], ["[aria-hidden=\"true\"] @div.fsElementContent#", 1481], ["[class*=\"mega-menu\" i] @div.mega-menu#", 1097], ["[role=menu] @ul.fsNavLevel2 menu-col column-1#", 325], ["noscript @noscript.#", 279], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @section.fsElement fsLayout fsThreeColumnLayout f#fsEl_38064", 206], ["button @button.expander#", 157], ["[role=menubar] @ul.fsNavLevel1#", 67]], "sample": "", "role": "sub", "link_label": "Mission and Vision", "link_score": 3.5}, {"url": "https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "title": "About - Jakarta Intercultural School", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[18, "a", -54, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [40, "div", 503, 1, 0, "About JIS"], [16, "p", 503, 1, 0, "JIS is a diverse community of learners representing over 70 nationalities where every student is supported to achieve their very best."], [17, "h2", 695, 1, 1, "About"], [18, "p", 987, 0, 0, "We create, teach, and learn together across three garden-like campuses with leading-edge facilities that support independent inquiry, critical thinking, problem-solving, and collaborative study."], [18, "p", 1094, 0, 0, "We play sports, put on drama productions, paint, sculpt, engineer, and create. Our students are able to explore and grow in a safe environment and are encouraged to follow their passions to be as successful as they can be."], [18, "p", 1230, 0, 0, "The JIS community is global and stretches well beyond the school. As we always say, Once a Dragon, Always a Dragon!"], [40, "h2", 1515, 0, 1, "What does it mean to be Best For the World?"], [16, "p", 1515, 0, 0, "Our mission is to “learn in Indonesia to be Best for the World.” It means we emphasize creating positive change in our community, wherever we are."], [25, "p", 2104, 0, 1, "Community of Care"], [14, "p", 2156, 0, 0, "We are a Community of Care that values respect and inclusivity"], [25, "p", 2104, 0, 1, "Engaging with Indonesia"], [14, "p", 2156, 0, 0, "We engage with Indonesia through collaborative teacher-training programs and the JIS Bhinneka Tunggal Ika (BTI) student scholarship"], [25, "p", 2104, 0, 1, "Creating Change"], [14, "p", 2156, 0, 0, "Creating change alongside service organizations in and out of the classroom"], [40, "h2", 2421, 0, 1, "Where we learn"], [17, "p", 2471, 0, 0, "We learn across three sprawling campuses in Jakarta: Pattimura Elementary, Pondok Indah Elementary, and Cilandak."], [30, "h2", 2805, 0, 0, "Accreditation & Memberships"], [18, "p", 2861, 0, 0, "JIS is recognized by both the Indonesian government and several internationally certified accreditation bodies. As a legal entity, we are a yayasan (nonprofit organization) operating as a Satuan Pendidikan Kerjasama (SPK), or Joint Cooperation School."], [18, "p", 2959, 0, 1, "JIS is accredited by:"], [18, "p", 2959, 0, 1, "We are also proud members of:"], [25, "h2", 3416, 0, 1, "Leadership"], [16, "p", 3463, 0, 0, "The leadership team at JIS are educators first and foremost and lead the school in innovation and learning. With a principal and vice principal at each campus, we are able to make a large community feel small."], [25, "h2", 3416, 0, 1, "Apple Distinguished School"], [16, "p", 3463, 0, 0, "We are pleased to have been recognized as an Apple distinguished school for the last 10 years. Our Apple one-to-one program allows students to personalize and creatively express their learning."], [18, "div", 4176, 0, 0, "video loaded"]], "links": [["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "About"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Mission and Vision"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/school-leadership", "School Leadership"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/work-at-jis", "Work at JIS"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/child-safeguarding", "Child Safeguarding"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/belonging", "Belonging"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media", "News & Media"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/75-birthday", "75 Birthday"], ["https://id.jisedu.or.id/about", "Bahasa Indonesia"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/work-at-jis", "Work at JIS"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/news-and-media/blog", "JIS Blog"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about", "About"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/mission-vision", "Mission and Vision"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/school-leadership", "School Leadership"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/campus", "Campuses"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/work-at-jis", "Work at JIS"], ["https://www.jisedu.or.id/about/child-safeguarding", "Child Safeguarding"], ["https://ww